hadiths[49]{hadithnumber,text}:
"3701","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sharaab peene wala but ki pooja karne wale jaise hai; aur sharaab peene wala Laat aur Uzza ki pooja karne wale jaise hai."
"3702","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Chehre bigar jayein."
"3703","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tumhare do gawah ya us ki qasam."
"3704","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Meri ummat ke bure bak-bak karne wale, shekhi maarne wale, munh phula kar bolne wale hain; aur meri ummat ke behtareen akhlaq mein sab se achche hain."
"3705","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Meri ummat ke bure wo jo ne'mat mein pale hain: jo tarah tarah ke khane khate hain, tarah tarah ke kapre pehente hain aur guftagu mein shekhi maarte hain."
"3706","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Bura khana waleeme ka khana hai: use rokta hai jo us ke paas aaye aur us ki taraf bulaya jata hai jo use napasand kare; aur jo dawat qubool na kare us ne Allah aur us ke Rasool ki nafarmani ki."
"3707","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Buri kamayi zanakaar aurat ka meher, kutte ki qeemat aur hajaam ki kamayi hai."
"3708","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Bure log wo jo Allah ke naam par mange phir na de."
"3709","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aadmi mein buri cheezein ghabrahat wali kanjoosi aur zakhm lagane wala buzdili hain."
"3710","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Momin ka sharaf raat ko us ki namaz hai aur us ki izzat logon ke haathon mein jo hai us se be-niyaazi hai."
"3711","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Shabaan Rajab aur Ramazan ke maheene ke darmiyan hai jis se log ghaafil hain; us mein bandon ke aamaal uthaye jate hain; pas main chahta hun ke mera amal siwa is ke na uthaya jaye ke main roze se hun."
"3712","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Do shaakhein hain jinhein meri ummat nahi chhoregi: nauha aur nasabon mein taan."
"3713","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Irq-un-Nisa ka ilaaj dehati bakri ki charbi hai jo pighlayi jaye phir teen hisson mein taqseem ki jaye, phir har din khaali pet aik hissa piya jaye."
"3714","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Meri shafa'at meri ummat ke kabeera gunah walon ke liye hai."
"3715","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apne bhai ko teen baar yarhamukallah kaho; phir jo zyada ho to wo nazla ya zukaam hai."
"3716","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Zameen mein Allah ke gawah us ki makhlooq par us ke ameen hain, qatl kiye jayein ya mar jayein."
"3717","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Maine bachpan mein apne chachaon ke saath Hulf-ul-Mutayyabeen mein haziri di; mujhe khushi nahi ke mere liye surkh oont hon aur main use torun."
"3718","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sabr ka maheena aur har maheene mein teen din zamane bhar ke roze hain."
"3719","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Do maheene kami nahi karte, eid ke maheene: Ramazan aur Zul-Hijja."
"3720","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujhe Hood aur us ki behnon ne boodha kar diya."
"3721","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujhe Hood aur us ki behnon ne burhape se pehle boodha kar diya."
"3722","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujhe Hood aur us ki behnon ne Mufassal mein se boodha kar diya."
"3723","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujhe Hood, Waqia, Mursalaat, Amma Yatasa'aloon aur Izas Shamsu Kuwwirat ne boodha kar diya."
"3724","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Shaitan shaitana ke peeche chalta hai, yaani kabootar."
"3725","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Bakri jannat ke janwaron mein se hai."
"3726","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Shaam hashr aur nashr ki zameen hai."
"3727","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Manhoosiyat teen mein hai: aurat, ghar aur sawari mein."
"3728","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Hazir wo dekhta hai jo ghayeb nahi dekhta."
"3729","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Chhupa shirk ye hai ke aadmi aadmi ki jagah ke liye amal kare."
"3730","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Meri ummat mein shirk safa par cheonti ke rengne se zyada chhupa hua hai."
"3731","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein shirk cheonti ke rengne se zyada chhupa hua hai; aur main tumhein aisi cheez batata hun ke jab tum use karoge to tum se chhote aur bare shirk ko door kar dega: tum kaho: Ae Allah, main teri panah mangta hun ke main tere saath shirk karun jabke main jaanta hun, aur us ki maghfirat mangta hun jo main nahi jaanta; tum ise teen baar kaho."
"3732","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Shareek apne saqb ka zyada haqdar hai jab tak ho."
"3733","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sher kalaam ke darje mein hai; pas us ka achcha kalaam ke husn jaise hai aur us ka bura kalaam ki qubh jaise hai."
"3734","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Shifa teen mein hai: shehad ka sharbat, singi lagane wale ka cheera aur aag ka dagh; aur main apni ummat ko daghne se rokta hun."
"3735","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Shuf'a har shirkat mein hai zameen, chauthayi ya deewar mein; us ke liye durust nahi ke beche yahan tak ke apne shareek par pesh kare, wo le ya chhore; phir agar wo inkar kare to us ka shareek us ka zyada haqdar hai yahan tak ke use khabar de."
"3736","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Shuf'a us mein hai jis mein hudood waaqe na hui hon; phir jab hudood waaqe ho jayein to shuf'a nahi."
"3737","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Suraj aur chaand qayamat ke din lapete jayenge."
"3738","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Shuneez maut ke siwa har bimari se dawa hai; aur wo maut hai."
"3739","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Shahadat saat hain Allah ke raaste mein qatl ke siwa: Allah ke raaste mein qatl hone wala shaheed hai; taoon-zada shaheed hai; doobne wala shaheed hai; pehlu ke waram wala shaheed hai; pet ki bimari wala shaheed hai; jalne wala shaheed hai; aur jo chat ke neeche dab kar mare wo shaheed hai; aur wo aurat jo jama ke saath mare shaheed hai."
"3740","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Shaheed wo jo Allah ke raaste mein pehli saf mein larte hain aur apne chehron se tawajje nahi hatate yahan tak ke qatl ho jayein; pas yehi jannat ke baala-khanon mein dalenge; tumhara Rab un par hansega; beshak Allah taala jab apne momin bande par hanse to us par hisaab nahi."
"3741","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Shaheed paanch hain: taoon-zada, pet ki bimari wala, doobne wala, chat ke neeche dabne wala aur Allah ke raaste mein shaheed."
"3742","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Shaheed jannat ke darwaze par neher ke kinare sabz gumbad mein hain; un ka rizq jannat se subah-shaam un par nikala jata hai."
"3743","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Maheena untees ka hai; pas roza na rakho yahan tak ke use dekho aur iftar na karo yahan tak ke use dekho; phir agar tum par badal chha jaye to ginti tees poori karo."
"3744","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Maheena untees ka hota hai aur tees ka hota hai; pas jab tum use dekho to roza rakho aur jab tum use dekho to iftar karo; phir agar tum par badal chha jaye to ginti poori karo."
"3745","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Shaheed qatl ki takleef nahi pata siwa is ke jaise tum mein se koi chutki ka chhuna pata hai."
"3746","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Shaheed qatl ka chhuna nahi pata siwa is ke jaise tum mein se koi chutki pata hai jo use kaati jaye."
"3747","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Shaheed apne ghar walon mein se sattar ki shafa'at karega."
"3748","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Safed baal momin ka noor hai; Islam mein jo aadmi aik baal safed kare to us ke liye har safed baal par neki hoti hai aur us se darja buland kiya jata hai."
"3749","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Boodhe ka jism kamzor ho jata hai; aur us ka dil do cheezon ki mohabbat par jawan hai: lambi zindagi aur maal ki mohabbat."
